  "description": "Step into this beautifully updated, 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom apartment offering the perfect blend of modern convenience and vibrant urban living. Situated in a secure, gated complex on the edge of the Perth CBD, this property is ideal for professionals, couples, or anyone looking for a stylish, low-maintenance lifestyle. <br/><br/>Features include: <br/><br/>- Brand new, fully renovated kitchen maximised for efficiency. It comes fully equipped with premium appliances including a dishwasher, washing machine, gas cooktop, and a cutting-edge combination microwave/oven/airfryer.<br/>- The entire apartment has been freshly painted throughout, offering a crisp, clean canvas ready for you to make it your own. <br/>- Stylish floorboards throughout, making cleaning and overall upkeep a breeze! <br/>- Enjoy a seamless flow through the light-filled open-plan living, dining and kitchen area- perfect for entertaining or relaxing. <br/>- Stay comfortable year-round with a split system AC located in the open living area. <br/>- Located within a secure, gated complex and includes one dedicated car space. <br/><br/>Location, Location, Location! <br/>Nestled on Bulwer Street, you are just moments away from Perth's best cafes, restaurants, parks, and public transport. <br/>Walk to the CBD, explore the nightlife of Northbridge, or grab a coffee in Highgate- everything you need is right on your doorstep. <br/><br/>Don't miss out on this inner-city gem! <br/>Please register to inspect under the available home open times or if you have any further inquiries please contact- pm2@housesmart.com.au",
